<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO raises Gistbrocades to buy.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO raises Gistbrocades to buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (11/07)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector-----------Price--------Broker-------</p>
<p>    Gistbrocades    Pharmaceuticals  67.90	  ABN AMRO</p>
<p>COMMENT:(BUY from hold) Prices of pencillin and derivatives bottoming out and seen recovering from 2H97. Production halts in China, India and eastern Europe to restore balance of supply and demand, therefore 1998 outlook for Gistbrocades has changed.</p>
<p>After almost 50 pct underperformance in past year, valuation levels start looking good with shares trading at 24 pct discount to market based on revised 1998 forecast. Target price NLG 80.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG): EPS   pvs EPS   P/E   Cashflow/shr Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)    3.98  3.98	17.1     7.08	  1.60</p>
<p>    1997		 4.25  4.25	16.0     7.55	  1.70</p>
<p>    1998		 4.80  4.40	14.1     8.20	  1.75</p>
<p>    1999		 5.35  4.70	12.7     8.83	  2.14</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
